 {
  "node_id": "p69_19",
  "index": 19,
  "text": "capture the definition of such behavior — typically as a protocol (pure abstract interface)\nclass (see section 1.7.5) — along with detailed comments delineating precisely what behavior\nis expected. In this way, new output devices may be introduced by applications at will; the\nonly caveat is that these new concrete implementations satisfy the contract (see Volume II,",
  "bbox": [
